  "full_original_hypotheses": "d>=2; non-elementary finitelygenerated hyperbolicGamma; Psubset1..d-1 withM=cardP>=2; faithfulP-Anosovrho:Gamma->SL(d,R),Zariskidense; M finitefirstmoment/countablesupport/supportsemigroup contains twoindependentloxodromics. Originalshared assumptions source173-179, definitions source137-145 and218-289 retained.",
